# This file is for reference only. 
# Each package has its own .env file that should be configured:
#
# 1. packages/nouns-contracts/.env
#    - Copy from packages/nouns-contracts/.env.example
#    - Configure: INFURA_PROJECT_ID, ETHERSCAN_API_KEY, MNEMONIC
#
# 2. packages/nouns-webapp/.env
#    - Already exists with default values
#    - May need to update REACT_APP_INFURA_PROJECT_ID
#
# 3. packages/nouns-bots/.env (optional)
#    - Copy from packages/nouns-bots/.env.example
#    - Configure Twitter/Discord credentials if needed
#
# For local development with Docker, most environment variables are already configured
# in docker-compose.yml to work with the local setup.